The three different biases in DV-LSTM are supposed to capture various types of information for a document: 
$\bl$ is to capture the abstract and distributed word embeddings from the sigmoid compression layer; 
$\b_m$ is to capture the long-span sequential text information in a document, enabling by the recurrent structure and different gates in LSTM cell;
$\bc$ is to capture the word-class information. 
